## Tech Stack

| Technology | Version | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Next.js | 14+ (App Router) | Framework — SSR, routing, API routes |
| React | 18+ | UI component library |
| CSS Modules | — | Scoped component styling |
| Lucide React | Latest | Icon library |
| Inter (Google Fonts) | — | Typography |
| Razorpay Checkout.js | Latest | Payment modal (client-side) |
| @supabase/supabase-js | Latest | Client-side Supabase SDK |
| @supabase/auth-helpers-nextjs | Latest | Auth session management |

---

## Why Selected

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| Next.js over plain React | SSR for donation page SEO, API routes eliminate separate backend |
| App Router over Pages Router | Latest Next.js standard, server components, better layouts |
| CSS Modules over Tailwind | Scoped styles, no external dependency, matches project simplicity |
| Lucide over FontAwesome | Lightweight, tree-shakable, consistent design |
| Inter font | Clean, modern, highly readable — ideal for trust-based donation UI |

